{"id":"c671b4998e1fa84d","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-recursive-enumerable.md","title":"Recursive Enumerable","display":"df-recursive-enumerable — Recursive Enumerable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-recursive-enumerable","aliases":["58-df-recursive-enumerable"],"display":"df-recursive-enumerable — Recursive Enumerable","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-recursive.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-recursive-enumerable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-recursive-enumerable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive-enumerable — Recursive Enumerable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da0bcf2e3f060472\" href=\"?note=da0bcf2e3f060472\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-recursive.md\">../batch07/58-df-recursive.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> (set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{pRec}\\)</span> (class of partial recursive functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"da0bcf2e3f060472\" href=\"?note=da0bcf2e3f060472\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-recursive.md\">../batch07/58-df-recursive.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}_S\\)</span> (recursively enumerable predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}enumerable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RE}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{pRec}\\;\n(f:\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\land A=\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}enumerable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RE}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{pRec}\\;\n(f:\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\land A=\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Recursively enumerable sets are ranges of partial recursive functions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-recursive.md","status":"resolved","id":"da0bcf2e3f060472","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-recursive.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-recursive.md","status":"resolved","id":"da0bcf2e3f060472","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{pRec}$ (class of partial recursive functions, see [[../batch07/58-df-recursive.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}enumerable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RE}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{pRec}\\;\n(f:\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\land A=\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":825,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1054","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-recursive-enumerable.md|58-df-recursive-enumerable]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["da0bcf2e3f060472"]}